<title>UK: First Choice names Ian Clubb chairman.</title>
<headline>First Choice names Ian Clubb chairman.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-03-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>British holiday operator First Choice Holidays Plc said on Monday that Ian Clubb would succeed Michael Julien as chairman when Julien retires at the end of July.</p>
<p>First Choice said in a statement Clubb was currently executive deputy chairman.</p>
<p>The company said it had also appointed Tony Campbell, trading director of stores group Asda Group Plc, and Terry Green, executive director at The Burton Group Plc, as non-executive directors from April.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 4017</p>
